Runtime Options:
  --no-prompt              Never prompt interactively (same as setting
                           FRODO_NO_PROMPT).

Commands:
  check-locked-status      [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Check the lock status of
                           the environments.
  check-promotion-reports  [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Retrieve promotion
                           reports. Defaults to the latest report if no option
                           is specified.
  check-promotion-status   [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Check the current
                           promotion status.
  lock-tenants             [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Lock tenants and wait
                           until they are locked.
  rollback                 [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Roll back the previous
                           promotion.
  run-dryrun-promotion     [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Run a dry-run
                           configuration promotion without applying changes.
  run-promotion            [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Run a configuration
                           promotion.
  unlock-tenants           [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Unlock tenants and wait
                           until they are unlocked.

Utilities:
  help                     display help for command


Run without a sub-command to enter interactive mode."
